<p><strong>Mission:</strong> We find our mission is to give both guests and locals an opportunity to do sports and outside activities all the year round by using high technologies and excellent services; we reach out for developing professional alpine skiing and snowboarding sports as well as support Russian sports competitive recovery.</p>

<p><strong>Goals:</strong> Healthy lifestyle promotion among the population of the city and the entire Krasnoyarsk territory; developing fitness and sports to improve living standards in the city and in the Krasnoyarsk territory; supporting alpine skiing and snowboarding development in the Krasnoyarsk territory; empowerment of sports idols as an evolution factor of young generation. </p>

<p><strong>Aims:</strong> encourage citizens of the city and the Krasnoyarsk territory for healthy lifestyle; provide a wide range of services for high quality family vocations 12 months a year; develop infrastructure for mass sport activities; provide facilities for comfortable and safe recreation by using high technologies; provide facilities for training sports reserve and the sports of records; organize projects that may attract young people to sports lifestyle. </p>